          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/care-settings/asc.html\">Ambulatory surgery centers</a></span></span></p>\n<p>Every ASC has a different mission and set of goals. That’s why our team starts by learning yours. Then, we create tailored solutions that maximize your clinical, financial and operational outcomes.</p>\n",
