          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 21 2021 19:09:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/care-settings/stryker-care-at-home.html\">Home care</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p>If you're looking for easy ways to care for someone at home or manage your own care, Stryker home care products help you provide hospital-quality care at home. Shop our products online or contact our customer care team to help you determine which home health supplies are right for your needs.</p>\n",
