          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 21 2021 19:09:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/vocera/workplace-communications.html\">Workplace communication</a>s</span></span></span></p>\n<p>In workplaces where team members are on the go and safety is a priority, Stryker's Vocera wearable, hands-free communication helps everyone stay connected. Within your facility or beyond, communicate quickly with the right person at the right time. Explore our solutions for education, long-term care, veterinary hospitals and hospitality.</p>\n",
